WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.150
If your prep is MiraLAX, this video will walk you through exactly how to take

2
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.320
it.

3
00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.240
Just follow along step by step.

4
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:12.290
For this prep, you'll need two 238-gram bottles of MiraLAX powder and three 28

5
00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:13.520
ounce bottles of Gatorade.

6
00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:18.390
Your Gatorade cannot be red or purple. Stick to a different clear or light

7
00:00:18.390 --> 00:00:19.520
colored flavor.

8
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.200
If you'd rather not use Gatorade, you can substitute the same amount of water

9
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.160
at every step below.

10
00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:28.680
From the moment you wake up on the day before your procedure, you'll be on

11
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:29.840
clear liquids only.

12
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.480
No food, and you should drink as much as you can.

13
00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:38.000
Good options include clear chicken, beef or vegetable broth, and bone broth.

14
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.430
Sports drinks like Gatorade, Powerade, or Propel, and juices like white

15
00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:42.720
cranberry,

16
00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:45.520
white grape, apple, limeade, or strained lemonade.

17
00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:51.360
Black coffee or tea, iced tea, Kool-Aid, Sprite, seltzer, ginger ale,

18
00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:56.100
Boost Breeze, and water are also fine, along with popsicles, Italian ice, and

19
00:00:56.100 --> 00:00:56.720
Jell-O.

20
00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:01.440
Just avoid anything red or purple, dairy products, orange juice, tomato juice,

21
00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:04.720
grapefruit juice, alcohol, or anything with a cream base.

22
00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:10.920
At 5:00 PM, mix half a bottle of MiraLAX, about 3/4 cup, with one 28

23
00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:11.760
ounce bottle of

24
00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:16.540
Gatorade. Drink an 8-ounce cup of the solution every 15 minutes until it's

25
00:01:16.540 --> 00:01:17.120
gone.

26
00:01:17.120 --> 00:01:21.920
At 7:00 PM that same day, mix the remaining half of that MiraLAX bottle with a

27
00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:23.040
second 28-ounce

28
00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:27.510
bottle of Gatorade, and drink it the same way. An 8-ounce cup every 15

29
00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:28.240
minutes.

30
00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:31.920
Continue drinking as many clear liquids as you can once that's done.

31
00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:35.750
The morning of your procedure, six hours before your arrival time, open your

32
00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:36.080
second

33
00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:40.800
and final bottle of MiraLAX. Mix half the bottle with your last 28-ounce bottle

34
00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:41.520
of Gatorade,

35
00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.920
and drink the entire mixture over the next hour.

36
00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:48.060
You'll have half a bottle of MiraLAX left over when you're done, that's

37
00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:48.720
expected,

38
00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:51.920
since this prep only calls for one and a half bottles in total.

39
00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:56.000
You must drink all of the prep solution as directed, even if you're already

40
00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.440
passing clear liquid.

41
00:01:57.440 --> 00:02:01.390
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

42
00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:02.000
the clearest

43
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:06.430
view during your procedure. If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may

44
00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:07.440
need to reschedule,

45
00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:11.920
and neither of us wants that. Please drink plenty of liquids throughout the

46
00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:12.480
process to

47
00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:16.540
prevent dehydration. Staying hydrated will help you feel better and help the

48
00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:17.520
prep do its job.

49
00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:22.320
However, do not eat or drink anything, including water, for four and a half

50
00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:23.200
hours before your

51
00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:27.050
arrival time. You may brush your teeth during this time, just don't swallow any

52
00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:27.600
water.

53
00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:32.720
If you use an inhaler, please use it as usual about 3 hours before your

54
00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:33.600
procedure,

55
00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:37.200
and bring all of your inhalers with you, you may be asked to use them again

56
00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.800
just before your exam.

57
00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:43.170
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom, applying

58
00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:44.000
a petroleum-based

59
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:48.710
ointment or diaper rash cream can really help. That's it. You've got this.

60
00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.240
Follow the timing,

61
00:02:50.240 --> 00:02:54.400
finish the full dose, and stay hydrated. If you have any questions at all,

62
00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.680
don't hesitate to call our office. We're here to help.
